---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';

const effectiveDate = 'November 10, 2026';
---

<Base
	title="Privacy Policy | MyHostAdvantage"
	description="How MyHostAdvantage collects, uses and protects information on myhostadvantage.com."
>
	<SiteHeader />

	<main class="section">
		<article class="container prose">
			<span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
			<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
			<p class="prose-meta">Effective {effectiveDate}</p>

			<p>
				This policy explains what information MyHostAdvantage ("we," "us") collects when you visit
				myhostadvantage.com, how we use it, and the choices you have.
			</p>

			<h2>Information we collect</h2>
			<h3>Information you give us</h3>
			<p>
				When you sign up, we collect your name, email address, business name, domain name (if you provide one) and
				billing choice. Payment details are entered on a secure checkout page run by Stripe; we never see or store your
				full card number.
			</p>
			<h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
			<p>
				Our website hosting provider may record standard server logs, including IP addresses, for security and
				reliability.
			</p>

			<h2>How we use information</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>To create and manage your hosting and WordPress site.</li>
				<li>To bill your subscription and send receipts.</li>
				<li>To contact you about your account, your site and support requests.</li>
				<li>To keep the site secure and prevent abuse.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>We do not sell your personal information, and we do not use it for third-party advertising.</p>

			<h2>Service providers</h2>
			<p>We rely on a small number of providers to run this site. They process information on our behalf:</p>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Stripe</strong>: payment processing and subscription billing.</li>
				<li><strong>Supabase</strong>: secure storage of account and order records.</li>
				<li><strong>Resend</strong>: delivery of account emails.</li>
				<li><strong>GitHub Pages</strong>: hosting for this marketing website.</li>
				<li><strong>Infrastructure and network providers</strong>: the data centers and networks that run customer
					WordPress sites.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				We may also disclose information if required by law, or to protect the rights, safety and security of
				MyHostAdvantage, our customers or others.
			</p>

			<h2>How long we keep it</h2>
			<p>
				We keep account and billing records for as long as you're a customer and afterwards as required for tax and
				accounting purposes. When you cancel, your site's files and backups are deleted after your final billing
				period ends, unless you ask us for a copy first.
			</p>

			<h2>Your choices</h2>
			<p>
				To see, update or delete the information you've sent us, reply to any email from us and we'll take care of
				it. Depending on where you live, you may have additional rights to access, correct or delete your personal
				information, and we'll respond to any such request.
			</p>

			<h2>Security</h2>
			<p>
				We use reasonable safeguards to protect your information. Your initial WordPress password is encrypted, shown
				to you once through a secure link, and then deleted from our records. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure, however.
			</p>

			<h2>Children</h2>
			<p>This site is intended for adults. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.</p>

			<h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
			<p>If we update this policy, we'll post the new version here and change the effective date above.</p>
		</article>
	</main>

	<SiteFooter />
</Base>
